    {
      "name": "status",
      "displayName": "Deployment & Governance",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "status_text",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Deployment and data-governance status\n",
                "\n",
                "**VERIFIED:** Installed catalog `john_snow_labs_adverse_drug_and_product_reaction`, schema `drug_and_product_reaction`, and three readable source tables.\n",
                "\n",
                "**NOT DEPLOYED:** No `drugsafety360_bronze`, `drugsafety360_silver`, `drugsafety360_gold` or data-quality job resources have been created here. This assistant connection supports SQL/Genie reads and AI/BI dashboard management, not writing Unity Catalog objects or workspace notebook/job deployment.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Refresh semantics:** The provider sample is dated historical/reference data, not a Kafka/live adverse-event stream. Source changes could be detected on a scheduled batch poll, subject to provider updates and Free Edition quotas. Label date (`Date_Of_Most_Recent_SPC`) is NOT the adverse-event occurrence date.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Privacy:** Never expose `drug_relationship_database.Remarks_by_Patient` in public dashboards; review provider licensing and downstream access before copying any source data.\n",
                "\n",
                "**Interpretation:** Counts are product/reaction reference rows and annotation labels, not number of patients, reports, risk, incidence, proof of causality, or medical advice."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 10
          }
        }
      ],
      "pageType": "PAGE_TYPE_CANVAS",
      "layoutVersion": "GRID_V1"
